WEBVTT

00:03:29.840 --> 00:03:32.405
As a group, we need to decide if —

00:03:32.405 --> 00:03:33.698
bloop bloop —

00:03:33.698 --> 00:03:35.161
(Laughter)

00:03:35.161 --> 00:03:37.184
Hi, who just joined?

00:03:37.184 --> 00:03:41.993
No? I thought I heard a beep. (Laughter)

00:03:41.993 --> 00:03:43.629
Sound familiar?

00:03:43.629 --> 00:03:45.606
Yeah, it sounds familiar 
to me, too.

00:03:45.606 --> 00:03:47.662
A couple of weeks after I put that online,

00:03:47.662 --> 00:03:50.463
500,000 people in dozens of countries,

00:03:50.463 --> 00:03:52.103
I mean dozens of countries,

00:03:52.103 --> 00:03:53.287
watched this video.

00:03:53.287 --> 00:03:56.641
And three years later, it's still getting 
thousands of views every month.

00:03:56.641 --> 00:03:58.608
It's close to about a million right now.

00:03:58.608 --> 00:04:00.616
And in fact, some of the biggest
companies in the world,